---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About - Time-Life 3 Intel"
  description="About Time-Life 3: Centralizing intel, rumors, leaks and official announcements for Half-Life 3."
  canonical="https://time-life3.com/about"
>
  <main>
    <section class="about-container">
      <h1 class="about-title">
        MISSION STATUS: <span class="highlight">GATHERING INTEL</span>
      </h1>
      <div class="about-content">
        <p>
          The objective of this project has evolved. While we continue to track
          the days since <span class="hl-bold">Half-Life 2: Episode Two</span>,
          this space is now dedicated to centralizing <span class="hl-bold"
            >rumors, leaks, and official announcements</span
          > regarding the arrival of Half-Life 3.
        </p>
        <p>
          In the silence left by official channels, the community remains our
          best source of hope. A gamer at heart and a programmer by trade, I
          created this hub to sift through the noise and document the search for
          the conclusion we’ve waited defining years for.
        </p>
        <p>
          The day a sequel is officially confirmed, this counter will transform
          into a countdown to release. Until then, we remain operational,
          keeping a watchful eye on every fragment of data. <span
            class="hl-bold">...Rise and shine, Mister Freeman.</span
          >
        </p>
        <p class="legal-disclaimer">
          <i
            >Legal Disclaimer: This project is independent and is not affiliated
            with Valve Corporation or the Half-Life franchise. No copyrighted
            materials have been used.</i
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  main {
    padding: 120px 2rem 4rem;
  }

  .about-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    width: 100%;
    background: rgba(10, 6, 0, 0.6);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 120, 0, 0.3);
    padding: 3rem;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .about-container::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -1px;
    left: -1px;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--hl-primary);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--hl-primary);
  }

  .about-container::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1px;
    right: -1px;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--hl-primary);
    border-right: 2px solid var(--hl-primary);
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: var(--hl-primary);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 120, 0, 0.2);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(212, 120, 0, 0.3);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-title {
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
  }

  .highlight {
    color: #ff4444;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 68, 68, 0.5);
  }

  .about-content {
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .about-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--hl-accent);
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .about-content p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .hl-bold {
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .legal-disclaimer {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(212, 120, 0, 0.2);
    padding: 1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 120, 0, 0.2);
  }
</style>
